# With no creature Bot1 controls the enters ability has no legal target (Bot2's Ornithopter is not "a creature you control"; the same
# ability with a creature of Bot1's on the battlefield is in the other Celestial Armor scenarios), so it is
# not put on the stack (CR 603.3d) and the Armor stays on the battlefield unattached; Bot2's Ornithopter gains nothing and the
# stack is empty. Bot1 casts it at instant speed on Bot2's turn 2, which the flash lets it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Celestial Armor
Island x3
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Plains x20

